James requested assistance in decoding a garbled text relating to irrigation strategies for small farmers adapting to climate change. I identified the issue as an incorrect character encoding that displayed as "√" symbols. The original Portuguese text was decoded to "Irrigação como estratégia de adaptação de pequenos agricultores às mudanças climáticas: Aspectos econômicos," which translates to "Irrigation as an adaptation strategy for small farmers to climate change: Economic aspects" in English. I offered further assistance or context if needed.
